rmat="epo"><addressbook><name>HIRASAWA YUTAKA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>IWAKIRI KENICHIRO</name> <address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MITSUI MINING &amp; SMELTING CO</name> <address><country>JP</country> </address> </addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKANO OSAMU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMAMOTO TAKUYA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HIRASAWA, YUTAKA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IWAKIRI, KENICHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MITSUI MINING &amp; SMELTING CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKANO, OSAMU</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMAMOTO, TAKUYA</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HIRASAWA YUTAKA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>IWAKIRI KENICHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKANO OSAMU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMAMOTO TAKUYA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HIRASAWA, YUTAKA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IWAKIRI, KENICHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKANO, OSAMU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMAMOTO, TAKUYA</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A method for simply forming a circuit with fine pitch on a copper-clad laminated board by solving the problem that the thickness of the etching copper layer is increased because of the through-hole plating and via-hole plating.  A method for manufacturing a double-sided printed wiring board or a multilayer printed wiring board having three or more layers requiring interlayer connection copper plating of a through-hole and a via-hole, wherein a copper foil with a carrier foil of a peelable type is used as the copper foil disposed at the outer layer of the printed wiring board, holes for a through-hole and a via-hole are formed without peeling the carrier foil, desmearing and interlayer connection copper plating are conducted, carrier foil is peeled, registration of the outer layer circuit pattern with the copper foil disposed at the outer layer is carried out, and etching is carried out.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un procédé de fabrication simple de circuit à rubans étroits sur une carte laminée cuivrée, qui permet de résoudre le problème de l'accroissement de l'épaisseur de la couche de cuivre à graver dû à la métallisation des trous et des trous traversants. L'invention concerne en outre un procédé de fabrication de carte imprimée double face, ou multicouche à trois ou plus de trois couches, nécessitant la métallisation en cuivre de trou ou de trou traversant de connexion intercouche, qui consiste à utiliser comme feuille de cuivre une feuille de cuivre à feuille support pelable destinée à être placée à la couche externe de la carte imprimée, à pratiquer des percements de trou et de trou traversant sans peler la feuille support, à effectuer un nettoyage ("desmearing") et une métallisation en cuivre de connexions intercouche, à peler la feuille support, à aligner la configuration du réseau de conducteurs de la couche externe avec la feuille de cuivre placée à la couche externe, et à effectuer la gravure.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>